      ":question/problem": "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y+z &=2 \\\\ x+2y+2z &=0 \\\\ x+3y+z &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system. Select the solution $(x,y,z)$.",
